  ;; L50-W2 + Loop 64 Graph 18 (ZvZ Ravager Cap): Keep ZvZ Ravagers <= 20% of Roach+Ravager
  ;; (`0` below 6 Roaches, `min(3-4, floor(roaches / 4))`) so fragile Ravagers never replace
