                              2)]
                         [else 1])))))
  ;; W6-P0-2-rt / L25-P0-3 (`#27` 2 Forges on 3 Gates): Gate non-detection live Protoss Forge
  ;; behind >= 4 Gateways (2-base) / >= 6 Gateways (3-base) + >= 16 army supply so Gateways
